10308312070","profileHandle":"mukiya21","content":"hoin ho timi pani try gara ☺️","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-09-03T19:56:36.000Z","createdAt":"2026-09-09T12:28:32.615Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T12:28:32.615Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T04:29:13.968Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T13:32:33.921Z"},{"id":"cnt_784bd136a850065a626f835e7e39","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"curlytalesme","profileDisplayName":"curlytalesme","format":"video","caption":"#MyGoToCorner With the dashing Bollywood actor and entrepreneur Vivek Oberoi! ✨🔥 This time, Vivek takes us to his go to corner in Dubai, Khadak in Jumeirah, where we put his knowledge of his favourite dishes to the test! 🍽️ From dishes the chef makes especially for him to giving his food picks a fun Bollywood movie connection, Vivek knows exactly what belongs on his table. (Vivek Oberoi, Bollywood, entrepreneur, Dubai celebrity, Indian vegetarian food, Khadak Jumeirah, celebrity food favourites, Dubai restaurants) #VivekOberoi #Khadak #CelebrityInterview #Dubai","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_0bd0aebbe42201f4d3ec1808bcd5","publishedAt":"2026-09-03T15:12:16.000Z","profileId":"prf_05ca18b1f5aaaeeb2a1683114390","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7681327094239972628/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":7184,"likesCount":125,"sharesCount":33,"commentsCount":1,"interactionsCount":159,"engagementRatePerViews":2.213251670378619,"engagementRatePerFollowers":1.7335368512865243,"profileFollowersCount":9172,"profileFollowingCount":0,"profilePostsCount":786,"mediaCount":1,"duration":133,"hashtags":["#mygotocorner","#vivekoberoi","#khadak","#celebrityinterview","#dubai"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"7681327094239972628","profilePlatformId":"6703861202374214662","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/curlytalesme/pfp.webp","profileBio":"UAE’s Leading Online Food, Travel & Lifestyle Platform","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"Breathe the food in first. Okay, so this is my go-to place in Dubai. That's the calorie police on the way. This restaurant is called Khadak. Why I love this restaurant is this exceptional food. We've seen actor Vivek, we've seen entrepreneur Vivek, but today we're meeting foodie Vivek. You've got non-vegetarian famous dishes married to vegetarian recipes, but I challenge you, you can't tell. So what we're sipping away here, this beautiful pink elixir is kombucha. Line it up. She's so good. That is the equivalent of tundra kebab sitting on a little freshly made shirmal, but you won't believe it, it looks like meat, but it's made completely from carrots. That's so delicious. It's carrots. My mum would be so proud of me eating so much carrots right now. Here we've got one of the star items of Khadak, which is the Karari Kale Chaat. Wow. You can hear the crunch. Yeah. That is so good. What I love about this is the way they do tarka here in front of you. You get a homely experience that you would as a kid. You're not doing a great job. I'm so sorry. She's sneaking stuff outside of the plate. Hello. How is this Shethnaved, the man behind all of this madness? Everything is amazing. I love that. You know this jackfruit shami you tasted? Yeah. It's invented for him. Charminaar, chicken 65. I would correlate company. Makhkan Malai. Maybe Satya? The love story? Purani Dirli Sti. My gangster movie, Shooter at Lokhanwala. Correlate. So well. So do we have some dessert recommendations? Can you just magically make this food disappear please? Snap. One, two. Wow. There you go. There's your sizzling chocolate brownie with 72% dark chocolate cacao. There we go. And? And Kofi dressed up with his lovely pistas and this really really pretty edible flowers on top with the falud. at the bottom. Go for it. Yummy? Oh my god. This was Vivek's go-to corner. Let us know who you want to see next. And as always, don't forget to follow Curly Tales Middle East for more. Bye! Bye!","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.001,"endSeconds":1.121,"text":"Breathe the food in first."},{"startSeconds":1.121,"endSeconds":4.561,"text":"Okay, so this is my go-to place in Dubai."},{"startSeconds":5.441,"endSeconds":7.061,"text":"That's the calorie police on the way."},{"startSeconds":11.561,"endSeconds":12.881,"text":"This restaurant is called Khadak."},{"startSeconds":13.061,"endSeconds":16.341,"text":"Why I love this restaurant is this exceptional food."},{"startSeconds":16.641,"endSeconds":19.081,"text":"We've seen actor Vivek, we've seen entrepreneur Vivek,"},{"startSeconds":19.141,"endSeconds":20.681,"text":"but today we're meeting foodie Vivek."},{"startSeconds":20.821,"endSeconds":24.041,"text":"You've got non-vegetarian famous dishes"},{"startSeconds":24.041,"endSeconds":26.041,"text":"married to vegetarian recipes,"},{"startSeconds":26.221,"endSeconds":27.621,"text":"but I challenge you, you can't tell."},{"startSeconds":27.741,"endSeconds":28.981,"text":"So what we're sipping away here,"},{"startSeconds":28.981,"endSeconds":33.101,"text":"this beautiful pink elixir is kombucha."},{"startSeconds":33.881,"endSeconds":34.701,"text":"Line it up."},{"startSeconds":34.961,"endSeconds":35.801,"text":"She's so good."},{"startSeconds":35.961,"endSeconds":37.741,"text":"That is the equivalent of tundra kebab"},{"startSeconds":37.741,"endSeconds":39.441,"text":"sitting on a little freshly made shirmal,"},{"startSeconds":39.541,"endSeconds":40.561,"text":"but you won't believe it,"},{"startSeconds":40.621,"endSeconds":41.521,"text":"it looks like meat,"},{"startSeconds":41.641,"endSeconds":42.961,"text":"but it's made completely from carrots."},{"startSeconds":45.021,"endSeconds":46.321,"text":"That's so delicious."},{"startSeconds":46.541,"endSeconds":46.741,"text":"It's carrots."},{"startSeconds":47.141,"endSeconds":49.481,"text":"My mum would be so proud of me eating so much carrots right now."},{"startSeconds":50.841,"endSeconds":53.841,"text":"Here we've got one of the star items of Khadak,"},{"startSeconds":53.961,"endSeconds":56.541,"text":"which is the Karari Kale Chaat."},{"startSeconds":57.501,"endSeconds":57.941,"text":"Wow."},{"startSeconds":57.941,"endSeconds":59.221,"text":"You can hear the crunch."},{"startSeconds":59.221,"endSeconds":59.621,"text":"Yeah."},{"startSeconds":60.621,"endSeconds":61.701,"text":"That is so good."},{"startSeconds":61.901,"endSeconds":65.261,"text":"What I love about this is the way they do tarka here in front of you."},{"startSeconds":65.401,"endSeconds":68.241,"text":"You get a homely experience that you would as a kid."},{"startSeconds":68.581,"endSeconds":69.661,"text":"You're not doing a great job."},{"startSeconds":69.841,"endSeconds":70.821,"text":"I'm so sorry."},{"startSeconds":72.121,"endSeconds":73.901,"text":"She's sneaking stuff outside of the plate."},{"startSeconds":74.341,"endSeconds":74.661,"text":"Hello."},{"startSeconds":74.661,"endSeconds":75.501,"text":"How is this Shethnaved,"},{"startSeconds":75.501,"endSeconds":76.781,"text":"the man behind all of this madness?"},{"startSeconds":76.781,"endSeconds":77.781,"text":"Everything is amazing."},{"startSeconds":77.781,"endSeconds":78.281,"text":"I love that."},{"startSeconds":78.281,"endSeconds":80.261,"text":"You know this jackfruit shami you tasted?"},{"startSeconds":80.261,"endSeconds":80.641,"text":"Yeah."},{"startSeconds":80.641,"endSeconds":81.521,"text":"It's invented for him."},{"startSeconds":81.521,"endSeconds":82.821,"text":"Charminaar, chicken 65."},{"startSeconds":82.821,"endSeconds":84.481,"text":"I would correlate company."},{"startSeconds":84.481,"endSeconds":85.681,"text":"Makhkan Malai."},{"startSeconds":85.681,"endSeconds":86.741,"text":"Maybe Satya?"},{"startSeconds":86.741,"endSeconds":87.921,"text":"The love story?"},{"startSeconds":87.921,"endSeconds":89.441,"text":"Purani Dirli Sti."},{"startSeconds":89.441,"endSeconds":90.801,"text":"My gangster movie,"},{"startSeconds":90.801,"endSeconds":92.261,"text":"Shooter at Lokhanwala."},{"startSeconds":92.261,"endSeconds":93.061,"text":"Correlate."},{"startSeconds":93.061,"endSeconds":93.661,"text":"So well."},{"startSeconds":93.661,"endSeconds":96.761,"text":"So do we have some dessert recommendations?"},{"startSeconds":96.761,"endSeconds":99.161,"text":"Can you just magically make this food disappear please?"},{"startSeconds":99.161,"endSeconds":99.761,"text":"Snap."},{"startSeconds":99.761,"endSeconds":100.721,"text":"One, two."},{"startSeconds":100.721,"endSeconds":102.721,"text":"Wow."},{"startSeconds":102.721,"endSeconds":103.721,"text":"There you go."},{"startSeconds":103.721,"endSeconds":109.561,"text":"There's your sizzling chocolate brownie with 72% dark chocolate cacao."},{"startSeconds":109.561,"endSeconds":110.281,"text":"There we go."},{"startSeconds":110.281,"endSeconds":110.781,"text":"And?"},{"startSeconds":113.281,"endSeconds":120.001,"text":"And Kofi dressed up with his lovely pistas and this really really pretty edible flowers on top with the falud."},{"startSeconds":120.001,"endSeconds":122.801,"text":"at the bottom. Go for it. Yummy?"},{"startSeconds":122.801,"endSeconds":126.201,"text":"Oh my god. This was Vivek's go-to corner. Let us know who you want to see next."},{"startSeconds":126.201,"endSeconds":129.201,"text":"And as always, don't forget to follow Curly Tales Middle East for more. Bye!"},{"startSeconds":129.201,"endSeconds":129.701,"text":"Bye!"}],"frames":[],"audioPlatformId":"7681327186510400277","audioTitle":"original sound","audioAuthor":"curlytalesme","audioType":"original","audioCopyrighted":false,"popularComments":[{"platformId":"7681413435913143041","profilePlatformId":"7295038715129758726","profileHandle":"delicious854","content":"Name of restaurant","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-09-03T20:47:27.000Z","createdAt":"2026-09-07T18:21:04.279Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-07T18:21:04.279Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-09-07T11:47:14.907Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-11T19:40:38.108Z"},{"id":"cnt_379b82671d5092177b7dee945c42","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"easyplaterestaurant","profileDisplayName":"easyplaterestaurant","format":"video","caption":"syam rana magar in easy plates restaurant अब फेरि तपाइँको पालो 😍#easyplatesrestaurant #momochallenge #foryou #viralrestaurentinburdubai #nepalikalakarindubai @Easymobile bazaar Bur Dubai @easy_group236 @George&Dragon Sports Bar @New Easy Travel And Tours LLC @EasyBusinesswithAnil @easycoffeeandcakes \nWatch Syam Rana Magar's momo challenge at Easy Plates Restaurant, Bur Dubai — tasty reactions and viral moments. Call 0568431101 to visit. #easyplatesrestaurant #momochallenge\nEasy Plates Restaurant Bur Dubai momo challenge by Syam Rana Magar\n\nLead\nSyam Rana Magar hosts a momo challenge at Easy Plates Restaurant in Bur Dubai. The clip highlights his reactions, the restaurant name and contact (0568431101), and invites viewers to try the momos themselves.\n\nWhat the video shows\n- Location and contact: Easy Plates Restaurant, Bur Dubai — 0568431101 appears on the cover sticker. \n- Host and performer: Syam Rana Magar participates in the momo challenge. \n- Theme: “अब फेरि तपाइँको पालो” (Now it’s your turn) and the #momochallenge tag signal an invitation for others to try or recreate the challenge. \n- Reactions: The cover sticker includes audience feedback prompts like “कस्तो लाग्यो त Food??” and “Good👍,” emphasizing taste and quick reactions.\n\nWhy it matters\nThe clip promotes Easy Plates Restaurant as a destination for Nepali-style momos and positions Syam Rana Magar as a recognizable figure leading a shareable food challenge. The presence of multiple related accounts and tags (Easy Mobile Bazaar, Easy Group, George & Dragon Sports Bar, New Easy Travel And Tours LLC, Easy Business with Anil, Easy Coffee and Cakes) ties the restaurant into a local business network in Bur Dubai.\n\nHow to use this information\n- Visit: Call 0568431101 to reserve a table or ask about the momo challenge. \n- Recreate the challenge: Record your own momo reactions and tag #easyplatesrestaurant and #momochallenge to join the trend. \n- Follow related businesses: Look up the tagged Easy-group accounts and partners for events or cross-promotions.\n\nTakeaway\nEasy Plates Restaurant in Bur Dubai invites diners to try a momo challenge led by Syam Rana Magar. The video’s sticker and tags provide a clear call-to-action: taste the food, share your reaction, and connect with the restaurant via 0568431101. Would you take the momo challenge next?","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_148af31f23c6f6dc730e4176caa7","publishedAt":"2026-09-03T10:09:46.000Z","profileId":"prf_45bb2cddc8e73a176339c03fa7d2","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7681249138620534036/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":4843,"likesCount":329,"sharesCount":15,"commentsCount":3,"interactionsCount":347,"engagementRatePerViews":7.164980384059468,"engagementRatePerFollowers":0.47404371584699456,"profileFollowersCount":73300,"profileFollowingCount":10,"profilePostsCount":462,"mediaCount":1,"duration":50,"hashtags":["#easyplatesrestaurant","#momochallenge","#foryou","#viralrestaurentinburdubai","#nepalikalakarindubai"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"Easymobile"},{"id":"prf_bb97f51a1ebad442103e776317e8","platformId":"7376353271537009682","profileHandle":"easy_group236"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"George"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"New"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"EasyBusinesswithAnil"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"easycoffeeandcakes"}],"platformId":"7681249